# React feature patterns

## Feature folder

```
features/request-editor/
  ui/           # JSX only — props in, events out
  model/        # use-send-request.ts — resolve(DI) + TanStack
  lib/          # pure mappers, constants
```

## Logic placement

| Concern | Tool | Where |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Biz rules | use-cases | `application/use-cases` |
| Server/cache data | TanStack Query + `resolve(TOKENS.*)` | `features/*/model` |
| Ephemeral UI state | Zustand or local `useState` | `app/store` or component-local |
| Forms | TanStack Form + Zod | `model/` + `entities` schemas |
| Tables | TanStack Table | column defs in `model/` or `lib/` |
| Validation | Zod | `entities` |

## UI components

- Use **shadcn** from `@/components/ui` first; wrap in `shared/ui` only if Restly-specific.
- Pages must not call `useMutation`/`fetch` / `resolve` directly — go through feature `model/` hooks.
- Do not put DI in React Context — see `di.mdc`.

## Anti-patterns

- God store with HTTP + validation + UI flags in one file
- Importing `infrastructure/adapters` from `ui/` or `pages/`
- Importing one feature's `ui/` from another feature
